docs {
  # Send HTTP Request Through Tunnel
  
  This endpoint sends an HTTP request through a tunnel to a connected CLI client.
  
  ## URL Parameters
  
  - `client_id`: The ID of the connected tunnel client (e.g., "client1")
  
  ## Request Body
  
  ```json
  {
    "method": "GET|POST|PUT|DELETE|PATCH",
    "path": "api/endpoint",
    "body": "request body as string",
    "headers": {
      "Header-Name": "header-value"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Response
  
  ```json
  {
    "status": "sent",
    "request_id": "req_1695484800123456789",
    "client_id": "client1",
    "message": "Request sent to tunnel client"
  }
  ```
  
  The request will be forwarded to the CLI client's localhost application.
}